      "versionNonce": 1634375464,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ONE boolean mask, and EVERY layer is written under it. That is\nwhat makes \"many bands from whichever granule won the cell\"\ntrue rather than hoped for: the four OBS bands, the mineral id\nand its depth all come from the SAME look. Strictly greater,\nso the first observation wins a tie.\nVerified: band 1 of geometry_stack is bit-identical to a\nseparately declared view_zenith layer over 2.18 M cells.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ONE boolean mask, and EVERY layer is written under it. That is\nwhat makes \"many bands from whichever granule won the cell\"\ntrue rather than hoped for: the four OBS bands, the mineral id\nand its depth all come from the SAME look. Strictly greater,\nso the first observation wins a tie.\nVerified: band 1 of geometry_stack is bit-identical to a\nseparately declared view_zenith layer over 2.18 M cells.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
